      "dialogues": [
        {
          "dialogue_id": "D020",
          "speaker": "陆叔",
          "parenthetical": "",
          "text": "晚晚，你看看你，跑那么快做什么？脸色这么差，来，先坐下，陆叔给你洗个苹果。",
          "assertion_mode": "OBJECTIVE_FACT",
          "contradicts_fact_refs": [],
          "audience_should_notice": false,
          "character_knowledge_ref": ""
        },
        {
          "dialogue_id": "D021",
          "speaker": "林晚",
          "parenthetical": "",
          "text": "陆叔，我……我刚才在车站，好像看到一把红色的伞。",
          "assertion_mode": "UNCERTAIN_CLAIM",
          "contradicts_fact_refs": [],
          "audience_should_notice": false,
          "character_knowledge_ref": ""
        },
        {
          "dialogue_id": "D022",
          "speaker": "陆叔",
          "parenthetical": "",
          "text": "红伞？这阴天，车站里打伞的人多了去了。你是不是太累了，眼花了？",
          "assertion_mode": "OBJECTIVE_FACT",
          "contradicts_fact_refs": [],
          "audience_should_notice": false,
          "character_knowledge_ref": ""
        },
        {
          "dialogue_id": "D023",
          "speaker": "林晚",
          "parenthetical": "",
          "text": "陆叔，我早上出门的时候……是不是忘了什么？我好像……不记得把伞放在哪里了。",
          "assertion_mode": "UNCERTAIN_CLAIM",
          "contradicts_fact_refs": [],
          "audience_should_notice": false,
          "character_knowledge_ref": ""
        },
        {
          "dialogue_id": "D024",
          "speaker": "陆叔",
          "parenthetical": "",
          "text": "伞？你哪来的伞？你不是一直不喜欢带伞吗？",
          "assertion_mode": "OBJECTIVE_FACT",
          "contradicts_fact_refs": [],
          "audience_should_notice": false,
          "character_knowledge_ref": ""
        },
        {
          "dialogue_id": "D025",
          "speaker": "林晚",
          "parenthetical": "",
          "text": "陆叔，你口袋里……是什么？",
          "assertion_mode": "QUESTION",
          "contradicts_fact_refs": [],
          "audience_should_notice": false,
          "character_knowledge_ref": ""
        },
        {
          "dialogue_id": "D026",
          "speaker": "陆叔",
          "parenthetical": "",
          "text": "这个？修车用的工具，一根旧的撬棍头，顺手揣兜里忘了。",
          "assertion_mode": "DECEPTION",
          "contradicts_fact_refs": [
            "SC02-B05",
            "SC01-B10"
          ],
          "audience_should_notice": true,
          "character_knowledge_ref": ""
        },
        {
          "dialogue_id": "D027",
          "speaker": "陆叔",
          "parenthetical": "",
          "text": "晚晚，你累了。真的累了。听陆叔的话，好好睡一觉。睡醒了，就什么都记不起来了。",
          "assertion_mode": "DECEPTION",
          "contradicts_fact_refs": [
            "SC02-B03"
          ],
          "audience_should_notice": true,
          "character_knowledge_ref": ""
        },
        {
          "dialogue_id": "D028",
          "speaker": "林晚",
          "parenthetical": "",
          "text": "陆叔……你早上，是不是去过车站？很早……比我还早？",
          "assertion_mode": "QUESTION",
          "contradicts_fact_refs": [],
          "audience_should_notice": false,
          "character_knowledge_ref": ""
        },
        {
          "dialogue_id": "D029",
          "speaker": "陆叔",
          "parenthetical": "",
          "text": "晚晚，你说什么呢？陆叔不是一直和你在一起吗？从家里送你到车站，然后一起进的候车室。你忘了？",
          "assertion_mode": "DECEPTION",
          "contradicts_fact_refs": [
            "SC01-B03",
